    {
      "occurrence": 4,
      "number": 101,
      "number_raw": "101",
      "source_number": "101",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "唷，这就是那个滥杀无辜的人。我听说过你，你很幸运，要不是我带着这勋章，我会把你从这儿轰杀了。最好离开这座城市——现在。离我们的孩子远点儿。",
      "source_text": "唷，这就是那个滥杀无辜的人。我听说过你，你很幸运，要不是我带着这勋章，我会把你从这儿轰杀了。最好离开这座城市——现在。离我们的孩子远点儿。",
      "source_line_start": 5,
      "source_line_end": 5,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 5,
      "number": 102,
      "number_raw": "102",
      "source_number": "102",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你好先生！我叫贾斯丁·格林。是这个美丽城市的警长。在这美好的一天中有什么需要我效劳的？",
      "source_text": "你好先生！我叫贾斯丁·格林。是这个美丽城市的警长。在这美好的一天中有什么需要我效劳的？",
      "source_line_start": 6,
      "source_line_end": 6,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 6,
      "number": 103,
      "number_raw": "103",
      "source_number": "103",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "你好女士！我叫贾斯丁·格林。是这个美丽城市的警长。在这美好的一天中有什么需要我效劳的？",
      "source_text": "你好女士！我叫贾斯丁·格林。是这个美丽城市的警长。在这美好的一天中有什么需要我效劳的？",
      "source_line_start": 7,
      "source_line_end": 7,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 7,
      "number": 104,
      "number_raw": "104",
      "source_number": "104",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "那么, 快说！",
      "source_text": "那么, 快说！",
      "source_line_start": 8,
      "source_line_end": 8,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 8,
      "number": 105,
      "number_raw": "105",
      "source_number": "105",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "德克请我来杀个商人和他老婆。",
      "source_text": "德克请我来杀个商人和他老婆。",
      "source_line_start": 9,
      "source_line_end": 9,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 9,
      "number": 106,
      "number_raw": "106",
      "source_number": "106",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "德克想请我去杀一个叫简恩的人。",
      "source_text": "德克想请我去杀一个叫简恩的人。",
      "source_line_start": 10,
      "source_line_end": 10,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
    },
    {
      "occurrence": 10,
      "number": 107,
      "number_raw": "107",
      "source_number": "107",
      "audio": "",
      "source_audio": "",
      "text": "没什么，抱歉。",
      "source_text": "没什么，抱歉。",
      "source_line_start": 11,
      "source_line_end": 11,
      "number_occurrence": 1,
      "number_occurrence_count": 1,
      "effective": true
